## .NET
bin/
obj/
*.user

## Deployment package output (build-package.ps1)
dist/
*.zip

## Runtime artifacts
## NB: do NOT use a bare "data/" rule -- Git is case-insensitive on Windows and it would
## also ignore the source "Data/" folder. The *.db globs cover the SQLite files instead.
logs/
*.log
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

## IDE
.vs/
.idea/
*.suo
